    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd4ae64bdcdbe69e06d37dc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊──呼啊──！\r\n看……看见涡轮的全力了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ef4eb4bfac9693905f3c1a33a3aeb04b4d156be20651c9e5607d268d94e62b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dafa40067f134bc649759f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轰隆隆隆～！看到涡轮的速度了吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0908cdeda176ad461270eaafbf7711e5a003057b4db5e8634f4b07b06a8756e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca42a33c3be149dcaa550a81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力冲刺啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5478d2fd21a8fbc76624cc4cf5ca0730c661f8e3a8a43674a20e0ea68e5545c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5d4fef259d686683d7efe1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限爆发大喷射～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20006a6a46afcad70498be905579ad5bde6874d3006f38c790c683e123dcb240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d105d488e07f4e44bbb11a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游戏的服装很帅气吧！\r\n涡轮穿那件衣服时的招式～\r\n就叫二重双喷射涡轮全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0113822747c1f6eb7236a8f3d1bd20a81126b56b15605762b1d69b2a32335d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d85f703655e4b0c23b872b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "极限爆发大喷射～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20006a6a46afcad70498be905579ad5bde6874d3006f38c790c683e123dcb240",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72fcffadafb1b746733418e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛真开心～！素质！\r\n待会也叫上生野和诗歌剧，\r\n到游戏厅放松一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6e460018252fcd7230689c4609cc142433b8bf62f78eee1878438fe871cf9dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36a08395a0cc7fa56873817d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントミッションだっ！\r\nターボもお年玉欲しい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "013c06aba29ae42c46d4af8be7e7c55ea56fb9f75af9ea9f6f3338f7c2d723f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5ad7f6c653bed8d3f7f1c18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忘れずにもらっておくんだぞ。\r\nターボはちゃんと覚えてたっ！\r\nロイスに何回も言われたからな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bea9c786fceefef45bc1baf2a62a20843b24c73455353460781621ca0794299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5feff212d5f707129eb671aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游戏好像结束了！\r\n那么那么，接下来\r\n要玩哪个游戏～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca77956d43c4de28f0cae49d566976ccb19025bcf671fa70641bdf50dd5594a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa81da7a6c417758eae4704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮全开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2c7ac355b8159e63c55f0dacd54aee1e4f78930ceca419a0cc91d6d972bc32c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54c496a8c95c19d211c339a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdb50340c664332d42abe261bc6f6a958daa139c336bbc4c007a5f1588ca0572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:487996d2e7f1ad6df017c79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了太棒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0c4cf4623bfe0d30af0a65948f8f0bd8cab8deec50a0f8c68c4cd36330e8aac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe1ed7c4486f78efe0c26664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89882ade85c7f07617d3cf80b1e2a2c25829c20a4cfac6d840efccbb7799aae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b164575b116b8a585974fec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d89882ade85c7f07617d3cf80b1e2a2c25829c20a4cfac6d840efccbb7799aae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7769de05f42301ce667124a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼──！！\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e022d1725504f7cd4c7fa9d08bd62f93e069692f76113131ea2e8b6f9f56779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fba5c2d2eebe62a23b3e58c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼──！！\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e022d1725504f7cd4c7fa9d08bd62f93e069692f76113131ea2e8b6f9f56779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3b1e7d914a1f89df84bfc21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜呜呜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42285c30b0375487087b331b3f028ceaeb43bb99729f0bb5c6973b6d5b991792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e4c488e826eef1d3fda422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜呜呜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42285c30b0375487087b331b3f028ceaeb43bb99729f0bb5c6973b6d5b991792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c2fb6f1876c946c77bc88f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呜呜呜……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42285c30b0375487087b331b3f028ceaeb43bb99729f0bb5c6973b6d5b991792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38ecc238617c7751736f7ac3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火力全开炒热气氛啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c70dcdc752d9c2a0ce1b36cbca8d5e2271e9d6b720ab4551bfa4c8703ce665",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99c7e1eb229d893284eff008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮要用超快舞步让大家大吃一惊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c2775f1791dba726d2dfd46430e295feee14ea88f851032071cbb79b3c80ce8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6954deb7d20d530bb6163b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要让涡轮尽情奔跑喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0158a5430423c9260687056545073b47a3d4645d558a505ca56f6b4a490b0046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dbed129f6fff03f343306e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然当时啊！\r\n没能把涡轮的挑战书送到帝王手上！\r\n但这就是所谓的因过得服吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c495df27ad31cbf8b5903c19985b74bdb5aba7dd94aecc298c24808963c7d25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b500828fb027519314133c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "认真模式的涡轮，登场啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a346c6dcf1f3136e584d3c25baebd1c06f504fa98f53748d3f32d1f689600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1620caea75e61872a07920d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来跳舞吧！\r\n可不能输给帝王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5be06e6a8258142d314e79de82db4572e4311400c7176d7d6486008d5bdff924",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e916913fa97b230701e667c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服帅气到不行对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "001013acc2e843039a41159faf3b78b4b66501abd23d8618b4f9a3c65bc6c02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d9fc5a5f43bfd0d23f5139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮想把衣服的颜色啊～！\r\n弄得更加闪闪发光耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15522f66b05340c32068fa677c80c772c2ee2e665408b2020ee75370ec33bd5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbfa377c5753bbc3e83a570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你看看吧！\r\n这是涡轮擅长的月球漫步！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab61825e6b424ca2e14d7dbf6e646eac0ef14ae1b6df2156f85b702b4fff2393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dbc261bc31120064c0c364",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服让涡轮好兴奋呢～\r\n引擎全速运转啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0edfccc7e0c632ec0b3a9bac684ce2b935a8ba73bd90b7ae87dc5366fe79f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
