      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涡轮型态转换！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8c98883cf2382e9775970cd1e5c3f8b027f43a2b5f405c3b0013df62d8aed2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:254fe68a2293d047d7a9f4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论穿什么，涡轮都是最强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4904d971a3db7fe6605d32484ce9d0af58d1a0abffb40475cd78a2d2716e1a02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfd0d1dcbae810b740605b48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くつしたの色、間違えて\r\nはいてるんじゃないから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "770da29eaa04d80d327e250792117ae86c81b5550d60d6b2a49f5c8ddc74293b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1066",
